# Frontend design (admin)

- Direction: Modern Research Library + Enterprise Operations Dashboard.
- Reuse existing admin patterns and Tailwind tokens; do not invent a second design system.
- Real data only — no placeholder stats or dead buttons.
- Cover comparison: side-by-side source, confidence, edition, status; fast approve/reject.
- Tables: server-side pagination; never load all 86k rows into client JS.
- Accessibility: WCAG 2.2 AA target, keyboard operable, meaningful alt text.
- Preserve storefront look separately; this rule applies to `/admin/*` intelligence surfaces.
- Prefer extending `/admin/cover-recovery` into `/admin/ebook-intelligence` modules.
